-- V122__seed_dexter.sql: Dexter, Salesforce Commerce Cloud: seed plus the curated leaf mapping of its accessories.
--
-- Dexter (www.dexter.com.ar), Argentine multibrand sports retailer: footwear, apparel and accessories for football, running, training, swimming, tennis/padel, hockey,
-- cycling and outdoor. Measured 2026-11-20 (Search-UpdateGrid, cgid=root, 100 tiles per request, ordered by price): 9941 products announced, 9941 distinct tiles read in a real scrape
-- (77 s). 9252 tiles (93%) carry a taxonomy id (<gender>-<calzado|indumentaria|accesorios>-<leaf>) among the five category ids their tracking payload lists; the leaf is the site
-- category and its origin id is a hash of the gender-less key (SfccPage.idDeHoja), so one row serves hombre/mujer/infantil.
-- Mixed in nothing: rubro_forzado and rubro_por_defecto stay NULL, like Sportline, so RubroResolver decides by category (apparel and footwear = indumentaria, balls and rackets = deporte).
--
-- Leaf mapping: no new categories. The name classifier is right on apparel and footwear (those leaves stay unmapped, the name keeps Zapatilla Running vs Urbana), but it was silent or wrong on
-- the accessories (hockey sticks, rackets, mouth guards, referee whistles, jump ropes: Otros; a pack of socks: Conjunto; goalkeeper gloves: Botines; swim goggles: Protección Personal).
-- The curated leaf outranks the name on this store (NormalizerService.SITIOS_DONDE_LA_HOJA_GANA). Left unmapped on purpose: every calzado-* and indumentaria-* leaf, and the sets of
-- goggles/socks (the name already says Conjunto).
-- One single-line text blob (sitio_key|origen_id|nombre|categoria rows joined by ';', no raw newline: Sonar flags one inside a literal) split by the INSERT, not a literal per row: a string repeated
-- three times is Sonar S1192, and a long VALUES list of near-identical tuples is what Sonar CPD reads as duplicated code.
INSERT INTO sitio (nombre, sitio_key, plataforma, es_premium, rubro_forzado, origen) VALUES
    ('Dexter', 'dexter', 'sfcc', false, NULL, 'config')
ON CONFLICT (nombre) DO NOTHING;

